      "cooked": "<p>So I decided to give Advanced Progeny a Shot, for giggles.</p><p>Got a random team: Sky-Skraper/Unity/Legacy/DW Mister Fixer/Nightmist in Pike Industrial.</p><p>It was a cake walk, well mroe of a cake stroll. He (It?) got out Scion of Frost out first. But, for the next 4/5 rounds I stunted him.&nbsp;</p><p>Multiple Mistbounds, Heroic Interceptions, Take Downs, and Tower Monoliths, made him do little damage, and made sur ehe got only one scion out. My best (maybe only) Progeny Advanced win.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
